{"id":"e547c6741a595dea","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-zfc-analysis2-weak-convergence.md","title":"ZFC Analysis2 Weak Convergence","display":"df-zfc-analysis2-weak-convergence — ZFC Analysis2 Weak Convergence","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-analysis2-weak-convergence","aliases":["58-df-zfc-analysis2-weak-convergence"],"display":"df-zfc-analysis2-weak-convergence — ZFC Analysis2 Weak Convergence","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-dual-space.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-analysis2-weak-convergence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-analysis2-weak-convergence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-analysis2-weak-convergence — ZFC Analysis2 Weak Convergence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c740b73b26d2ecf9\" href=\"?note=c740b73b26d2ecf9\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-dual-space.md\">../batch16/58-df-dual-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> (normed space)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X^*\">\\(X^*\\)</span> (continuous dual of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c740b73b26d2ecf9\" href=\"?note=c740b73b26d2ecf9\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-dual-space.md\">../batch16/58-df-dual-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_\\bullet\\in X^\\omega\">\\(x_\\bullet\\in X^\\omega\\)</span> (sequence, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in X\">\\(x\\in X\\)</span> (candidate weak limit)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S(X)\">\\(\\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S(X)\\)</span> (normed-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c740b73b26d2ecf9\" href=\"?note=c740b73b26d2ecf9\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-dual-space.md\">../batch16/58-df-dual-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{WeakConverges}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\operatorname{WeakConverges}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (ternary predicate defined below)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}analysis2\\text{-}weak\\text{-}convergence} \\vdash \\operatorname{WeakConverges}(x_\\bullet,x,X)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S(X)\\land x_\\bullet\\in X^\\omega\\land x\\in X\\land \\forall \\phi\\in X^*\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(N\\leq n\\to |\\phi(x_\\bullet(n))-\\phi(x)|&lt;\\varepsilon)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}analysis2\\text{-}weak\\text{-}convergence} \\vdash \\operatorname{WeakConverges}(x_\\bullet,x,X)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S(X)\\land x_\\bullet\\in X^\\omega\\land x\\in X\\land \\forall \\phi\\in X^*\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(N\\leq n\\to |\\phi(x_\\bullet(n))-\\phi(x)|&lt;\\varepsilon)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Weak convergence is scalar convergence under every continuous linear functional.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-dual-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"c740b73b26d2ecf9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-dual-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-dual-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"c740b73b26d2ecf9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X^*$ (continuous dual of $X$, see [[../batch16/58-df-dual-space.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$x_\\bullet\\in X^\\omega$ (sequence, see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-dual-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"c740b73b26d2ecf9","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S(X)$ (normed-space predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-dual-space.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"X^*","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"x_\\bullet\\in X^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S(X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{WeakConverges}\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}analysis2\\text{-}weak\\text{-}convergence} \\vdash \\operatorname{WeakConverges}(x_\\bullet,x,X)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S(X)\\land x_\\bullet\\in X^\\omega\\land x\\in X\\land \\forall \\phi\\in X^*\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(N\\leq n\\to |\\phi(x_\\bullet(n))-\\phi(x)|<\\varepsilon)","display":true}],"bytes":1273,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1457","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-analysis2-weak-convergence.md|58-df-zfc-analysis2-weak-convergence]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["c740b73b26d2ecf9","36d7463d215be751"]}